{"unit_id":"CJL-1995__dsh-session-health#card-zh","repo":"CJL-1995/dsh-session-health","commit":"34694eeb8fba5b91509c881574e05e3a6b2df9ac","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-health 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话健康度插件。它在宿主侧注册 sessionHealth projection，将会话事件整理成可供界面读取的报告，并在右下角提供可拖动的悬浮入口。报告展示上下文窗口占用、压缩次数、缓存命中率、token 消耗、模型调用耗时、步骤和工具统计，也提供趋势图与健康等级建议。健康度低于阈值时，用户可让当前会话生成 handoff 总结提示。适合需要观察长会话状态并决定何时整理上下文的 DSH Web 用户；代码未声明额外 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:255-267","index.js:126-252","client.js:431-456"]}
{"unit_id":"CJL-1995__dsh-session-health#card-en","repo":"CJL-1995/dsh-session-health","commit":"34694eeb8fba5b91509c881574e05e3a6b2df9ac","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-health adds a draggable health widget to DSH Web. Its host projection folds session events into a report on context use, compactions, cache ratio, tokens, time, steps, tools, and trends. Users can queue a handoff summary when health is low. No extra key or external service is declared.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:255-267","index.js:126-252","client.js:431-456"]}
