{"unit_id":"CJL-1995__dsh-session-health#feature-1","repo":"CJL-1995/dsh-session-health","commit":"34694eeb8fba5b91509c881574e05e3a6b2df9ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-health 的功能「健康度与上下文报告」：根据上下文占用、压缩次数和缓存命中率计算分数与等级，并显示窗口用量和最近 prompt token。用户打开悬浮面板查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:126-189","client.js:270-323"]}
{"unit_id":"CJL-1995__dsh-session-health#feature-2","repo":"CJL-1995/dsh-session-health","commit":"34694eeb8fba5b91509c881574e05e3a6b2df9ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-health 的功能「Token 与耗时统计」：报告汇总输入、缓存读取、输出和推理 token，并统计模型生成与工具执行耗时、步骤明细及 token/耗时较高的工具。用户点击右下角按钮打开报告。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:126-145","index.js:191-246","client.js:300-344"]}
